<title>MEXICO: Mexico's UDI bonds real return 8.63 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's UDI bonds real return 8.63 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's UDI bonds were assigned at a price of 98.33734 UDIs and a real return of 8.63 percent at the primary auction on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In the last auction two weeks ago the UDI bonds had a real return of 8.22 percent.</p>
<p>Demand this week was 731.39 million UDIs compared to 150 million UDIs on offer from Banco de Mexico with a bid-to-cover ratio of 4.88.</p>
<p>Two weeks ago demand was 699.68 million UDIs with a bid-to-cover ratio of 4.66.</p>
<p>-- Henry Tricks, Mexico City newsroom (525) 728-9559</p>
</text>
